!!! A keyword never contains a separator, so a spelling that contains one is
!!! unconditionally a name. The reserved set therefore costs its single word,
!!! not the whole family of names built from it: "read" is the import keyword,
!!! and "read-file" is an ordinary paragraph name.
!!!
!!! The check is on the SPELLING, not the folded key. The key has its
!!! separators removed, so folding first would turn "re-ad" into the keyword
!!! "read". Both hyphen and underscore exempt, because they already fold
!!! together for identity -- otherwise "a_s" would collapse onto "as".
book naming.keywords

!!! Bare 'read' below is the import keyword.
read ny.lang.core

!!! Every one of these is a name, despite folding onto a keyword.
read-file  receives read-path as text returns text   begin paragraph give read-path end paragraph
read-level returns number                            begin paragraph give 1 end paragraph
re-ad      returns number                            begin paragraph give 2 end paragraph
val-ue     returns number                            begin paragraph give 3 end paragraph
in-to      returns number                            begin paragraph give 4 end paragraph
boo-k      returns number                            begin paragraph give 5 end paragraph
para-graph returns number                            begin paragraph give 6 end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    say read-file with read-path being "ok"
    say re-ad with nothing; say val-ue with nothing; say in-to with nothing
    say boo-k with nothing; say para-graph with nothing
    give 0
end paragraph

!!! 'forever' is polysemous by position: an unbounded loop after 'repeat', and
!!! unbounded lifetime (what other languages call 'static') as a declaration
!!! modifier. One relation -- without end -- applied to iteration or storage.
!!! It is always a keyword and never a name, so the lexer needs no feedback
!!! from the parser; only the parser assigns the meaning.
forever variable boot-count as number is 0

tick returns number begin paragraph
    variable spins as number is 0
    repeat forever
        set spins to spins plus 1
        when spins is at least 3 then stop repeating end when
    end repeat
    give spins
end paragraph
